   "kapitel": 1,
   "start": 0.0,
   "dauer": 5.054,
   "emotion": "spannend",
   "text": "In eighty seconds, you'll know: someone's framing your best friend."
  },
  {
   "nr": 2,
   "typ": "objekt",
   "kapitel": 1,
   "start": 5.054,
   "dauer": 3.662,
   "emotion": "erklaerend",
   "text": "But first, four thousand euros disappear."
  },
  {
   "nr": 3,
   "typ": "gesicht",
   "kapitel": 1,
   "start": 8.716,
   "dauer": 4.19,
   "emotion": "ernst",
   "text": "This is Sami, your best friend. He cracks jokes when he's scared."
  },
  {
   "nr": 4,
   "typ": "gesicht",
   "kapitel": 1,
   "start": 12.906,
   "dauer": 2.174,
   "emotion": "froh",
   "text": "“Maybe the cash box just quit.”"
  },
  {
   "nr": 5,
   "typ": "grossstadt",
   "kapitel": 2,
   "start": 15.08,
   "dauer": 4.55,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "Two thirty. Every Saturday, you two help at the city lost and found."
  },
  {
   "nr": 6,
   "typ": "fundhaus",
   "kapitel": 2,
   "start": 19.63,
   "dauer": 6.206,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "Twenty-four shelves. Umbrellas, teddy bears, one shoe. Damp cardboard smell."
  },
  {
   "nr": 7,
   "typ": "fundhaus",
   "kapitel": 2,
   "start": 25.836,
   "dauer": 3.95,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "This morning, shelf twelve held the youth center's donation box."
  },
  {
   "nr": 8,
   "typ": "fundhaus",
   "kapitel": 2,
   "start": 29.786,
   "dauer": 4.094,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "Rike runs the place. Her key ring rattles with every step."
  },
  {
   "nr": 9,
   "typ": "objekt",
   "kapitel": 3,
   "start": 33.88,
   "dauer": 4.502,
   "emotion": "erklaerend",
   "text": "Every pickup gets two receipts. One for the person, one for the archive."
  },
  {
   "nr": 10,
   "typ": "gesicht",
   "kapitel": 3,
   "start": 38.382,
   "dauer": 3.422,
   "emotion": "ernst",
   "text": "“Picked up at two seventeen. By Sami.”"
  },
  {
   "nr": 11,
   "typ": "objekt",
   "kapitel": 3,
   "start": 41.804,
   "dauer": 2.726,
   "emotion": "erklaerend",
   "text": "There's his name. With his signature."
  },
  {
   "nr": 12,
   "typ": "gesicht",
   "kapitel": 3,
   "start": 44.53,
   "dauer": 3.446,
   "emotion": "spannend",
   "text": "Sami goes pale. His next joke dies in his throat."
  },
  {
   "nr": 13,
   "typ": "gesicht",
   "kapitel": 3,
   "start": 47.976,
   "dauer": 3.23,
   "emotion": "ernst",
   "text": "“As of today, you don't volunteer here anymore.”"
  },
  {
   "nr": 14,
   "typ": "fundhaus",
   "kapitel": 3,
   "start": 51.206,
   "dauer": 4.166,
   "emotion": "ernst",
   "text": "You want to scream: it wasn't him. But screaming proves nothing."
  },
  {
   "nr": 15,
   "typ": "gesicht",
   "kapitel": 4,
   "start": 55.372,
   "dauer": 2.99,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "Two receipts. So there's a second one somewhere."
  },
  {
   "nr": 16,
   "typ": "archiv",
   "kapitel": 4,
   "start": 58.362,
   "dauer": 4.526,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "In the archive, blue shelves reach the ceiling. A light tube hums."
  },
  {
   "nr": 17,
   "typ": "archiv",
   "kapitel": 4,
   "start": 62.888,
   "dauer": 3.182,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "The copies hang on a red string, sorted by time."
  },
  {
   "nr": 18,
   "typ": "objekt",
   "kapitel": 4,
   "start": 66.07,
   "dauer": 4.31,
   "emotion": "erklaerend",
   "text": "You hold Rike's original up to the light. Cold, smooth paper."
  },
  {
   "nr": 19,
   "typ": "gesicht",
   "kapitel": 4,
   "start": 70.38,
   "dauer": 3.734,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "Behind Sami's name, there's a tiny blue fingerprint."
  },
  {
   "nr": 20,
   "typ": "gesicht",
   "kapitel": 4,
   "start": 74.114,
   "dauer": 2.438,
   "emotion": "ernst",
   "text": "“Blue? I only had a pencil today.”"
  },
  {
   "nr": 21,
   "typ": "archiv",
   "kapitel": 5,
   "start": 76.552,
   "dauer": 1.838,
   "emotion": "erzaehlend",
   "text": "You tilt the page into the light."
  },
  {
   "nr": 22,
   "typ": "objekt",
   "kapitel": 5,
